<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Effulgent" description="Privacy policy for Effulgent gifting enquiries and services in Auckland.">
  <section class="section"><div class="legal"><span class="section-kicker">Your information, handled with care</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated: 12 November 2026</strong></p><p>Effulgent respects your privacy. This draft explains what information may be collected when you contact us about personalised gifting, corporate orders, wrapping, or delivery.</p><h2>Information we may receive</h2><p>Depending on your enquiry, we may receive your name, phone number, company name, occasion, budget, recipient preferences, delivery location, preferred date, and message details.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><ul><li>To respond to enquiries and prepare quotes.</li><li>To source, personalise, wrap, and coordinate delivery of gifts.</li><li>To communicate about availability, changes, and confirmations.</li><li>To keep basic business records where required.</li></ul><h2>Sharing information</h2><p>We may share only the information needed with delivery providers, suppliers, or production partners involved in fulfilling your order. We do not sell enquiry information.</p><h2>WhatsApp</h2><p>If you choose to contact Effulgent through WhatsApp, your message is also processed by WhatsApp under its own terms and privacy policy. Avoid sending sensitive information that is not necessary for your enquiry.</p><h2>Retention and security</h2><p>We aim to keep information only for as long as reasonably needed for the enquiry, order, accounting, or legal purpose. We use reasonable safeguards, but no online system can guarantee absolute security.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask what personal information we hold about your enquiry or request a correction where appropriate by contacting us on WhatsApp at +64 22 126 0952.</p><p><em>This privacy policy is a website draft and should be reviewed for New Zealand Privacy Act compliance before launch.</em></p></div></section>
</Layout>
